"No salary rule was found to handle expenses in structure "
"'%(structure_name)s'."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró ninguna regla salarial para gestionar los gastos en la "
"estructura %(structure_name)s."

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid ""
"Only approved and posted expenses that were paid by an employee can be "
"reimbursed in a payslip."
msgstr ""
"Solo se pueden reembolsar en los recibos de nómina gastos aprobados y "
"registrados que  haya pagado un empleado."

